    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Emmett Shelton Bridge, named after the founder, links West Lake Hills to Austin across the Colorado River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Lake_Hills%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before becoming a city, the area was known for cedar‑cutting on limestone ridges above the Colorado River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
